    {
      "source": "A default constructor that can be used when the resolver itself is configured\nas a Spring bean and will have the <code>BeanFactory</code> injected as a result\nof ing having implemented <a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个默认构造函数，可用于当解析器本身被配置为 Spring 圈豆且因实现了<a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>而注入<code>BeanFactory</code>的情况。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "A constructor that accepts a <a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> useful if instantiating this\nresolver manually rather than having it defined as a Spring-managed bean.",
      "translation": "接受 `<a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>` 的构造函数，如果手动实例化此解析器而不是将其定义为 Spring 管理的 Bean 时很有用。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "An implementation of <a href=\"DestinationResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.core\"><code>DestinationResolver</code></a> that interprets a destination\nname as the bean name of a <a href=\"../MessageChannel.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageChannel</code></a> and looks up the bean in\nthe configured <a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个实现了 `<a href=\"DestinationResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.core\"><code>DestinationResolver</code></a>` 的类，它将目标名称解释为 `<a href=\"../MessageChannel.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageChannel</code></a>` 的 Bean 名称，并在配置的 `<a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>` 中查找该 Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"DestinationResolver.html#resolveDestination(java.lang.String)\">DestinationResolver</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"DestinationResolver.html#resolveDestination(java.lang.String)\">DestinationResolver</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve the given destination name.",
      "translation": "解析给定的目标名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"DestinationResolver.html#resolveDestination(java.lang.String)\">resolveDestination</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"DestinationResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.core\">DestinationResolver</a>&lt;<a href=\"../MessageChannel.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging\">MessageChannel</a>&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "`<a href=\"DestinationResolver.html#resolveDestination(java.lang.String)\">resolveDestination</a>` 在接口 `<code><a href=\"DestinationResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging.core\">DestinationResolver</a>&lt;<a href=\"../MessageChannel.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.messaging\">MessageChannel</a>&gt;</code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>beanFactory</code> - the bean factory to perform lookups against",
      "translation": "<code>beanFactory</code> - 用于执行查找的 Bean 工厂",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>name</code> - the destination name to resolve",
      "translation": "<code>name</code> - 要解析的目标名称",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the resolved destination (never <code>null</code>)",
      "translation": "解析后的目标（永远不为<code>null</code>）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked after the population of normal bean properties\nbut before an initialization callback such as\n<a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>InitializingBean.afterPropertiesSet()</code></a> or a custom init-method.",
      "translation": "在普通 Bean 属性填充之后，但在初始化回调（例如 <a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>InitializingBean.afterPropertiesSet()</code></a>）或自定义 init-method 之前调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Callback that supplies the owning factory to a bean instance.",
      "translation": "向 Bean 实例提供其所属工厂的回调。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">setBeanFactory</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">setBeanFactory</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code>` 中",
